  "timer_source": "def time_call(fn, iters=10, warmup=3):\n    for _ in range(warmup):\n        fn()\n    torch.npu.synchronize()\n    # host-pipelined wall time per call (what the evaluator's walltime sees)\n    t0 = time.perf_counter()\n    for _ in range(iters):\n        fn()\n    torch.npu.synchronize()\n    pipelined = (time.perf_counter() - t0) / iters\n    # device-serialized per-call time\n    per = []\n    for _ in range(iters):\n        torch.npu.synchronize()\n        t0 = time.perf_counter()\n        fn()\n        torch.npu.synchronize()\n        per.append(time.perf_counter() - t0)\n    per.sort()\n    return {\n        \"pipelined_ms\": pipelined * 1e3,\n        \"serialized_median_ms\": per[len(per) // 2] * 1e3,\n        \"serialized_min_ms\": per[0] * 1e3,\n    }\n\n\n",
  "flat_kernel_source": "@triton.jit\ndef _flat_kernel(\n    x_ptr,\n    out_ptr,\n    half_hidden,\n    total_out,\n    BLOCK: tl.constexpr,\n    MODE: tl.constexpr,\n):\n    pid = tl.program_id(axis=0)\n    offs = pid * BLOCK + tl.arange(0, BLOCK)\n    mask = offs < total_out\n    row = offs // half_hidden\n    col = offs - row * half_hidden\n    base = row * (2 * half_hidden) + col\n    gate = tl.load(x_ptr + base, mask=mask, other=0.0).to(tl.float32)\n    up = tl.load(x_ptr + base + half_hidden, mask=mask, other=0.0).to(tl.float32)\n\n    if MODE == 0:\n        activated = gate\n    elif MODE == 1:\n        activated = gate * (0.5 * (1.0 + tl.erf(gate * 0.7071067811865475)))\n    elif MODE == 2:\n        inner = 0.7978845608028654 * (gate + 0.044715 * gate * gate * gate)\n        activated = gate * (0.5 * (1.0 + inner * (0.0 + 2.0 / (1.0 + tl.exp(-2.0 * inner))) * 0.5))\n    else:\n        activated = gate * tl.sigmoid(1.702 * gate)\n\n    tl.store(out_ptr + offs, activated * up, mask=mask)\n\n\n",
  "observations": [
    "实际探针在两组各2^20个FP32样本中确认NPU F.gelu none/tanh逐位相同；同一输入的CPU double参考中，none更接近tanh公式而不是erf exact。适用范围为当前固定栈和已测样本，不推广所有CANN版本。",
    "性能探针的MODE=2并非正确tanh公式：inner乘sigmoid(2*inner)不等于tanh(inner)。该变体没有逐元素数值验收，不能当作有效候选或正确tanh实现的性能证据。参考公式部分使用torch.tanh，未受此kernel错误影响。",
    "去掉GELU计算后大输入仍然慢，seed_erf与seed_no_gelu、flat_erf与flat_no_gelu相近，说明仅替换激活公式不足以解决此诊断实现的主要性能差距。",
    "flat探针的half_hidden是运行时参数，每lane执行除法与行列映射；seed探针也有动态tile除法和stride。这是进一步检查实际IR、常量专门化与连续tile寻址的明确对象，未取得IR前不宣称全部已被编译器标量化。",
    "time_call均为host perf_counter加同步的墙钟范围，serialized项也包括host与同步开销，不能称为纯设备kernel活跃时间。torch_chain返回FP32而探针输出BF16，也没有计入正式KGS公平性能表。",
    "Codex仅离线核对冻结源和输出；没有改写活动CC源码、角色、原始结果，也没有新增并行设备任务。"
  ],
  "contribution": "CC/DeepSeek设计并执行NPU探针；Codex独立核对公式、计时范围和索引机制"
